    "summary": "Every shaper and summariser provider is built from the registry through familyProvider: CLI kind from registry.cliKind, canonical model, effort only when accepted, a chars inputLimit as the CLI input budget (a token limit such as haiku's gives none), an Ollama model's token limit as num_ctx; the summariser falls back to the family's summariserModel; resolveShaperKind's floor is the default family. CliProvider takes inputBudgetChars from options (CODEX_INPUT_BUDGET_CHARS removed) and models.shaper.ollamaNumCtx is no longer read. localToolLoopModel keeps its precedence (ollama cheap tier, listed coreModel, toolLoopModel with a warning). resolveValidateProvider reuses the router's CLI provider, else builds the default family's tier default through the same factory.",
